{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_3_30009_01_d",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:0b7f774b23309d281397e2310fb183a676be8651b29082fe6f59cf20259a139f",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_d:cmd-000019:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:45a2639bee133f79fa257c83a1284145a61c3e0a2c5692309a6e2fb52ad44dc9",
      "text": "练习室",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_d:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:62eaf177d82b26f9e9462d88572fa8011874e82dab529b11bea364c366e83832",
      "text": "是、是这种感觉吗……？\n你们两个觉得怎么样？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_d:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c9159872b5cf1e9524b399b94ca00d1d4658c20ce5e8753da01a4ea72805d16c",
      "text": "嗯——……笑容有点僵硬，看起来有点吓人呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_d:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c7edf3db6833a8efe43882c2a1b52b80a8014fc426634e9cef21a23259c450f3",
      "text": "看上去可不像是在街上\n给女朋友搭一把手的场景呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_d:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:954b555ff531cae21c540aee23a81da05404463dd6436957a763c5c637cb10f5",
      "text": "啰嗦。\n我这也是很努力在笑了好不好。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_d:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:10a626e8a3c2ee5be4bef2cd51d7d81148dd47fdc07c3f4e5270b772eb6f099c",
      "text": "哈哈，连我都感受到英雄的紧张了。\n来。看看刚才拍下的照片确认一下吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_d:cmd-000092:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:88c72f0e9710fb0c385007850d91305bb0d5d9c0b9ba5bf5f56a6af3eca0a486",
      "text": "啊——……这个确实有点……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_d:cmd-000100:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:56590e669e76c9e20fa11e708954f669a8aa65f6238c48c0ac85e8fd8fb6b995",
      "text": "看吧，我就说是这样了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_d:cmd-000109:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f6c5f4a3d36fbfd881035221f55e0fe2aa9d01f07f0490868cf0f46307becdf5",
      "text": "虽然特意看了爱情电影之类的去学习，\n但看别人演和自己来演果然是两码事啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_d:cmd-000119:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e81896177702d2936491fb6ec11f57fe0521995c413d0c7fab3dca6126228a83",
      "text": "总之，接下来换我来试一次。\n如果有什么觉得不对劲的地方，尽管指出来。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
